  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Live and Learn - Climate and WASH Resilience Community Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to provide a healthy living environment for everyone through the promotion of decent accessible sanitation &amp; hygiene facilities, utilization of nature-based approach for food security and strengthening the capacity of women, youth, community leaders, and people living with disability to enable them to effectively take the lead for change on climate actions and sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
